{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"58721c4c81e84430fff62a1b233e41a608284b0b851fb9a8d469702bd1c5623e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祭过偶像的食物"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["论到祭偶像之物，我们晓得我们都有知识。但知识是叫人自高自大，惟有爱心能造就人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["若有人以为自己知道什么，按他所当知道的，他仍是不知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["若有人爱 神，这人乃是 神所知道的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["论到吃祭偶像之物，我们知道偶像在世上算不得什么，也知道 神只有一位，再没有别的 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["虽有称为神的，或在天，或在地，就如那许多的神，许多的主；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然而我们只有一位 神，就是父—万物都本于他；我们也归于他—并有一位主，就是耶稣基督—万物都是借着他有的；我们也是借着他有的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但人不都有这等知识。有人到如今因拜惯了偶像，就以为所吃的是祭偶像之物。他们的良心既然软弱，也就污秽了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["其实食物不能叫 神看中我们，因为我们不吃也无损，吃也无益。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["只是你们要谨慎，恐怕你们这自由竟成了那软弱人的绊脚石。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若有人见你这有知识的，在偶像的庙里坐席，这人的良心若是软弱，岂不放胆去吃那祭偶像之物吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，基督为他死的那软弱弟兄，也就因你的知识沉沦了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你们这样得罪弟兄们，伤了他们软弱的良心，就是得罪基督。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所以，食物若叫我弟兄跌倒，我就永远不吃肉，免得叫我弟兄跌倒了。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}